Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Ninth Episode\NMr. X
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.90,0:02:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The army of Union X marches\Ntoward the border of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.22,0:02:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Its soldiers advance\Ndestroying everything:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.66,0:02:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,mountains, forests, cities
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They carry with them\Nformidable and powerful weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The huge army of Union X\Nis just outside Silverland, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The only obstacle placed in its\Npath is Mephisto's mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.66,0:02:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But they will raze it to the ground and then\Nthey will attempt to invade Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.18,0:02:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,General, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,General Ghana, sir, at your command!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.30,0:02:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I come from Headquarters!\NI am relaying the order to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...to conquer\NMephisto's mountain..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.46,0:02:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...before the bulk\Nof the troops arrive! - Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.38,0:02:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,At your command, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,On the march!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack! Move out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they practicing\Narchery and the spear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,To prevent the army\Nof Union X from invading Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It is now not far\Nfrom our borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They must practice every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So there are bad people\Neven among human beings?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately yes, Hecate. There aren't\Nmany, fortunately, but they do exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.58,0:03:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But humans can love\Nothers and be loved by them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, then I envy\Nhuman beings!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, there's no reason why you\Ncan't care for people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.26,0:03:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to care for people!\NTo love!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, it's time for\Nthe War Council!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, duty calls
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:04:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Will we see each other again, Sapphire?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.54,0:04:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see each other in the hawthorn\Nforest in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!\NThe army of Union X..
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...might pass\Nin front of the mountain where you live
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but you be careful too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire said that I could love\Nsomeone like humans do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hecate!\N- Mom! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me:\Nwhat were you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.02,0:05:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Hecate, it's no use\Ntelling me lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I can read your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're interested in\Nhuman beings, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.90,0:05:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Confess!\N- No, mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to me! Don't you know what a\Nterrible punishment would be inflicted...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...on a daughter of Mephisto if she\Nfell in love with a human being!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It is so! Perhaps you don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.66,0:05:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,..the punishment of the Great\NDevil. You tell her, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this punishment\Nof the Great Devil like?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The punishment that the\NGreat Devil inflicts is so terrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you understand, Hecate? You must\Nnever be a bad daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.82,0:06:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Well done! Now we can go\Nto the Witches' Conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- The Witches' Conference?!\N- Yes, the Witches' Conference!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.14,0:06:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, dear!\NHecate, take this amulet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It will inform me immediately\Nif anything should happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of the house\Nwhile we are away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.34,0:06:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Be on your guard\Nagainst the evil humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, mom! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,General, it seems that\Nthe Mephistos are moving away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! We will destroy the mountain!\NPrepare the weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.42,0:06:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, you must always remember\Nthat you are our daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,the daughter of Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You would receive a terrible punishment\Nfrom the Great Devil...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.66,0:07:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,..if you were to fall in love\Nwith a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.02,0:07:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, mom! But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, we will destroy the mountain!\NPrepare the weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.34,0:07:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward, fire! We must raze\Nthat mountain down there to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.02,0:07:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who is this?\N- She's a little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be the daughter of Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.38,0:07:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- We have to kill her!\N- Yes, let's burn her like a witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, better to kill her with the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! Mommy! Daddy!\N- Prepare to die, little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:08:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! What are you doing?\NLeave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- General, she's the daughter of Mephisto!\N- It's an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir, General Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.66,0:08:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- What shall we do with her, General?\N- I'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be responsible for her.\NLeave her to me, for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't take her with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to consult with Mr. X.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then,\Nno one will touch her! Clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here! Let me see your arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're wounded! Bring\Nsome disinfectant and a bandage!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We must treat\Nthis wound immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare a horse for her! Immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.70,0:08:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen to me:\NI have to take you to Mr. X,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,so follow me and don't play any tricks.\NDo you understand, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,May I know what your name is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.62,0:08:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, you can! My name is Hecate.\N- You have a nice voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:09:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hecate... It's a nice name.\N- And what is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?... My name is Ghana.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.02,0:09:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about\Nleaving Hecate alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.78,0:09:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Our daughter, by now,\Nis old enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened to our\Nhouse?! It's been wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.54,0:09:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hecate!\N- Someone must have kidnapped her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! There are tracks of many\Npeople who passed through here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.46,0:09:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's follow them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, soldiers!\NAnd Hecate is with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- But it's the devil!\N- Yes, it's Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto has come\Nto take revenge on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen my power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you another lesson,\Nif you don't give me back my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.22,0:10:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You devil of a Mephisto,\NI'm glad to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.78,0:10:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Mr. X,\Na human Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I intend to build\Nan "Empire of Evil" on Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- just like you!\N- An evil empire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!\NLet evil invade the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.50,0:11:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,As a first step, we\Nwill conquer Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.34,0:11:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Mephisto?\NDo you want to ally with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,His project interests me. If it's\Ntrue, I would be inclined to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.90,0:11:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's interesting. We\Ncould help you, but later!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! After you've returned our\Ndaughter Hecate to us, safe and sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.54,0:11:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll return her to\Nyou, but on one condition!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- What condition?\N- On the condition that you capture..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.58,0:11:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...the Princess of Silverland:\NSapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.30,0:11:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, little birds,\Nlittle inhabitants of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And how are you, friends? It's been a long\Ntime since we saw each other, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:12:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I came here because\Ntoday I have an appointment with Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.62,0:12:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here, in this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening? What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! We must kidnap you\Nand take you to Lord X!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.18,0:12:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no, I don't want to!\N- You cannot resist!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to me?\NAh, yes, I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I was taken by Mephisto\Nand brought to the Union X camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.02,0:13:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must think of how to escape\Nsomehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Princess escaped,\Nwe would be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done a fine job, Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Sapphire\Nis in your hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland almost is as well,\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.30,0:13:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true. And I owe it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.38,0:13:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.90,0:13:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I must save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.06,0:13:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that is the tent\Nwhere they are holding her prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.94,0:13:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is behind me? Oh, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, what are you doing here? You were\Nlooking at Sapphire's tent, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Help her, please! She's my\Nfriend! Please, Ghana, save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't, Hecate! I'm sorry. I\Nam a soldier and I have orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if your boss\Nis an evil man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, Ghana! If you don't want\Nto help her, then I'll take care of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to stop you,\Nbut I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.26,0:14:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!\NStay here, I'll take care of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hecate!\N- Shut up! Details later!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.66,0:14:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.18,0:14:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Alarm!\NThe prisoner is escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.34,0:14:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop!\N- Catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:15:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! We have to do\Nsomething, or they'll catch us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.62,0:15:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.14,0:15:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you pass!\NYou'll have to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a traitor, General Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Death to the traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.90,0:15:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If we could reach\Nthe Black Forest, we'd be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Ghana managed\Nto save himself...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.98,0:15:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Ghana let\NSapphire escape? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?\NGet her now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.62,0:15:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless!\NIt's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point,\Nthere's nothing left to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't catch her again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.14,0:15:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. X, with the prisoner\Nthere was also Mephisto's daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- who helped her escape.\N- What is this I hear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She dared to do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto, it seems that you\Nhave corrupted Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.30,0:16:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You must take care of it!\NWhat do you intend to do, Mephisto?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I have an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghana will lead\Nus on their trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I will bring Sapphire back.\NPromise not to hinder us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We will take care of\Nsettling the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I promise. Take Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember: keep your word!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Hecate and\NSapphire will come to his aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! They are too\Nfond of him not to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.42,0:16:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see that my plan will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I will let them\Nknow that Ghana is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.90,0:16:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.78,0:16:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, they will\Nboth come running here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- how kind-hearted they are!\N- Why did you light that fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.46,0:17:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up there!\NThe fire is bright..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,..and projects Ghana's image on\Nthe smoke that rises into the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.22,0:17:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Look, Sapphire!\NUp there! See? It's Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.46,0:17:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- Ghana! Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghana, I'm sorry...!\NThey've caught you, Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hecate! I think you really\Nlike that young General, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you think you love him?\N- Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.86,0:17:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you love him, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I already tell you that even\Na devil can love a human being?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go help him! It seems he's\Non the other side of the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's hurry!\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are! These are\Ndefinitely Hecate and Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.94,0:17:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stay hidden! I'm eager\Nto see what Hecate will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ghana! Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.42,0:17:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Ghana!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.78,0:18:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you regained consciousness, Ghana?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from here, Hecate!\NIt's a trap! Go away, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool, Ghana!\NI'll help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hecate!\NClimb a little higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.02,0:18:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing,\NHecate? You are disobeying...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.86,0:18:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...to all the advice\Nthat your mother and I give you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mom! Dad!\N- Get down from that tree right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.46,0:18:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't make me angry!\N- Well, what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, maybe..\Nit's better if you get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down, Hecate! Leave me alone!\NForget about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghana, I can't forget you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.46,0:18:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! Dad! No, I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.34,0:18:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.06,0:18:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mom and Dad!\NI feel like I have to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.74,0:18:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, don't do anything crazy!\NRemember what awaits you..
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.14,0:18:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...if you fall in love\Nwith a human being!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:19:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, I made a promise\Nto Mr. X!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down right now! I order you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If you made a deal with him,\Nremember...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,..that he's the last person in the world\Nwho will keep his word!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like the right moment!\NAre you ready to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.34,0:19:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, he betrayed us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate! We have to get Ghana down\Nas soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.10,0:19:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes!\N- Hurry! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hecate, are you alright?\N- Yes! I'll free you in a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.42,0:19:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Thank you, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Hecate!\NDon't stay there! It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get down!\N- The cannons keep firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.06,0:19:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll hit you! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.06,0:20:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn them! I must try\Nat all costs to stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Devil, I appeal to you!\NCome to my aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made a mistake this time, Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go against X,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,it means you want to side\Nwith Hecate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.02,0:20:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,who loves a human being!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If instead you want to defeat X,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.46,0:20:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to punish you!\NDo you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.34,0:20:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's nothing left for you to do\Nbut support X!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine, Ghana,\Nbut hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.26,0:20:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You've almost reached the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we have to think about Hecate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate! My daughter! My daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.26,0:21:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die, dear!\NMy love! My little darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.42,0:21:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.34,0:21:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.78,0:21:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you! You'll pay\Nfor what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.90,0:21:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My wrath is terrible, Mr. X!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:22:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a fine job, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.66,0:22:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you’re safe,\Nlook at me too, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.54,0:22:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.66,0:22:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.38,0:22:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Waters, seethe and break loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.82,0:22:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s flee! Help! Let’s run away! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.26,0:22:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They were truly stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.14,0:22:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus Mephisto and his\Nwife sacrificed their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.02,0:23:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s retreat for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.90,0:23:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.14,0:23:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your wife have\Nbroken the law of the Great Devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.42,0:23:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I will transform you respectively\Ninto a mountain and into a lake!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.22,0:23:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never be able to be demons again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.02,0:23:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.78,0:23:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You are guilty\Nof having loved a human being,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,therefore I will punish you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.62,0:23:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can no longer be a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.66,0:23:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...and enjoy the privileges\Nof demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.02,0:23:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on\Nyou will be a poor mortal!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.14,0:23:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.82,0:24:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, your parents\Nhave made the rainbow...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.38,0:24:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,..to wish you happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.62,0:24:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In this way, they are telling you to enter\Nthe world of human beings...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.94,0:24:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...and to live happily with Ghana.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.98,0:24:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ghana!\N- Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.10,0:24:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, friends!
